Description:
Golden Energy and Resources Limited is a Singapore listed leading energy and resources company in the Asia Pacific region.

GEAR’s businesses include:

* Mining of metallurgical coal through its subsidiary Stanmore Coal Limited (“Stanmore”) (75.33%*) operating in Australia;
* Mining of energy coal through its subsidiary PT Golden Energy Mines (“GEMS”) operating in Indonesia;
* Mining of gold through Ravenswood Gold Pty Ltd (“Ravenswood Gold“)(50%) operating in Australia;
* Various investments in renewable energy projects in Asia.
* Stanmore has coal resources estimates of 1.7 billion tons, marketable coal reserves estimates of 130.0 million tons and a coal handling preparation plant capacity of up to 3.5 million tons per annum.

GEMS has more than 2.9 billion tons of energy coal resources and more than 1 billion tons of coal reserves. Ravenswood Gold has 3.9 million ounces of gold resources and 2.6 million ounces of gold reserves.

DYNAMIC C4 has strong track record in delivering high performance signal acquisition and data recording systems. These systems are fully developed and qualified such that users can use our solutions out-of-box for their Radar, SDR and SIGINT applications.
We provide system integration services in these domain:

-Bus specifications like VPX/VPX-REDI, VME, CompactPCI, PCI-Express/PMC/XMC, FMC, etc.;
-CPU architectures like Intel, PowerPC;
-Operating Systems like VxWorks, Linux, Windows and devices drivers & BSPs;
-FPGA & High Speed Serial Interconnect technology;
-Radar/SDR/DSP applications and systems, Radar Imaging theory and applications

We provide leading edge signal acquisition and data recording solutions for defense and aerospace industry. Our products are successfully used in Radar, SDR and SatCom etc. applications. We are committed to provide high quality products and services to our customers.
